<section class="ltx_section" id="S15" lang="en">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">
<span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">15 </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">veScale</span>’s Efficient DTensor Dispatch in Each Operator</h2>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S15.p1">
<p class="ltx_p">Table <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.07003v1#S15.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ 15 veScale’s Efficient DTensor Dispatch in Each Operator ‣ veScale: Consistent and Efficient Tensor Programming with Eager-Mode SPMD"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> breakdowns the DTensor dispatch overhead for each of the representative operators.
The overhead is averaged across all occurrence for each operator.
The percentage is normalized per operator.</p>
</div>
